Loops:
1.for
2.while
3.do-while

For Loop:
initial   condition    inc/dec
for(start;   stop;     step)
{
statements....
}

While Loop:
start;
while(stop)
{
statements....
step;
}

Do - While Loop:
start;
do
{
statements....
step;
}while(stop);

for and while are Entry-Control Loops on the other hand do-while is exit - control loop.
